ddsp-guitar-infer

This package adapts source from Nicolas Jonason and collaborators' DDSP
Guitar demo code: https://github.com/erl-j/ddsp-guitar (Apache-2.0).
The GlotNet/WaveNet files under
src/ddsp_guitar_infer/ddsp_guitar_utils/glotnet_wavenet/ are retained
byte-for-byte from that source; its activations.py carries
"Copyright 2022 Lauri Juvela" and an Apache-2.0 notice. Other synthesis,
network, and preprocessing modules are adapted from the same project.
OpenMIRLab's inference packaging and changes are maintained by Paul.

Google Magenta's DDSP research (Engel et al., 2020) is a separate
architectural predecessor credited in the README.

The external unified.ckpt model is not distributed with this package.
Its license remains NOASSERTION; the code license and this NOTICE do not
grant terms for that separately hosted checkpoint.
